      "end_ms": 47660,
      "text": "我们来讲第一个用加法"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "start_ms": 51200,
      "end_ms": 54580,
      "text": "用加法克服"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "start_ms": 56680,
      "end_ms": 57600,
      "text": "庸俗的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "start_ms": 61620,
      "end_ms": 63000,
      "text": "唯物主义"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "start_ms": 66200,
      "end_ms": 67540,
      "text": "它是一个番外篇"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "start_ms": 67540,
      "end_ms": 71500,
      "text": "你可以看我之前弄的那个就是表象背后有什么"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "start_ms": 71500,
      "end_ms": 75000,
      "text": "那期你可以去看那期那期有完整的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "start_ms": 75020,
      "end_ms": 78200,
      "text": "那么怎么用加法克服庸俗的唯物主义呢"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "start_ms": 78200,
      "end_ms": 79880,
      "text": "就是说庸俗的唯物主义"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "start_ms": 79880,
      "end_ms": 81740,
      "text": "它会告诉你这个世界分两部分"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "start_ms": 81740,
      "end_ms": 84330,
      "text": "一部分是表象"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "start_ms": 84330,
      "end_ms": 85440,
      "text": "浅层的表象"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "start_ms": 85440,
      "end_ms": 86790,
      "text": "还有一部分是什么"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "start_ms": 86790,
      "end_ms": 89990,
      "text": "是本体啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "start_ms": 89990,
      "end_ms": 93200,
      "text": "这个本体一般唯物主义会说的就是物质"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "start_ms": 93200,
      "end_ms": 94420,
      "text": "物质"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "start_ms": 96300,
      "end_ms": 98690,
      "text": "表象的话就是人的心心灵的认识"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "start_ms": 98690,
      "end_ms": 100610,
      "text": "心心灵的认识"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "start_ms": 100610,
      "end_ms": 102360,
      "text": "心灵对物质的认识"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "start_ms": 104000,
      "end_ms": 105580,
      "text": "这个为什么是有问题的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "start_ms": 105580,
      "end_ms": 107860,
      "text": "就是这种它是一种本质主义的二元对立啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "start_ms": 107860,
      "end_ms": 109600,
      "text": "本质主义的二元对立"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 36,
      "start_ms": 114820,
      "end_ms": 118800,
      "text": "要完成对于这个二人对你的客服很简单"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 37,
      "start_ms": 118800,
      "end_ms": 120420,
      "text": "我们进一步加一个东西"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 38,
      "start_ms": 120420,
      "end_ms": 122700,
      "text": "就是做加法加法"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 39,
      "start_ms": 124360,
      "end_ms": 125820,
      "text": "加一个啥呢"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 40,
      "start_ms": 126420,
      "end_ms": 127040,
      "text": "加一个"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 41,
      "start_ms": 127040,
      "end_ms": 130400,
      "text": "你要意识到唯物主义里面这个物质永远是什么"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 42,
      "start_ms": 130400,
      "end_ms": 131480,
      "text": "被什么东西支配的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 43,
      "start_ms": 131480,
      "end_ms": 132440,
      "text": "庸俗的唯物主义"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 44,
      "start_ms": 132440,
      "end_ms": 136610,
      "text": "你要意识到这个物质下面还有一层叫做法则"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 45,
      "start_ms": 139850,
      "end_ms": 141480,
      "text": "规律啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 46,
      "start_ms": 141480,
      "end_ms": 147100,
      "text": "法则自然法则法则这一层它是什么"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 47,
      "start_ms": 149219,
      "end_ms": 151519,
      "text": "它是个加法法则"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 48,
      "start_ms": 151519,
      "end_ms": 153049,
      "text": "这个东西是什么"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 49,
      "start_ms": 153049,
      "end_ms": 154380,
      "text": "看不见"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 50,
      "start_ms": 155959,
      "end_ms": 157329,
      "text": "看不见"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 51,
      "start_ms": 157329,
      "end_ms": 160060,
      "text": "但是什么可理解"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 52,
      "start_ms": 162020,
      "end_ms": 164800,
      "text": "看不见可理解的一个东西表象"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 53,
      "start_ms": 164800,
      "end_ms": 165970,
      "text": "这个东西是什么"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 54,
      "start_ms": 165970,
      "end_ms": 168100,
      "text": "是一个看得见"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 55,
      "start_ms": 171179,
      "end_ms": 172879,
      "text": "但是这个无意义的东西"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 56,
      "start_ms": 172879,
      "end_ms": 174379,
      "text": "表象是没有没有意义的嘛"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 57,
      "start_ms": 174379,
      "end_ms": 176170,
      "text": "你这样说的不过是表象而已"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 58,
      "start_ms": 176170,
      "end_ms": 179470,
      "text": "本质主义不就是说这不过是表象主的表象而已"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 59,
      "start_ms": 179470,
      "end_ms": 181910,
      "text": "它归根结底是本质在起作用"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 60,
      "start_ms": 181910,
