    {
      "ordinal": 75,
      "start_ms": 214439,
      "end_ms": 216319,
      "text": "那么在庸俗的唯物主义里面"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 76,
      "start_ms": 216319,
      "end_ms": 218600,
      "text": "这个本体只不过是个傀儡"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 77,
      "start_ms": 225540,
      "end_ms": 226400,
      "text": "雷怎么写"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 78,
      "start_ms": 226400,
      "end_ms": 229580,
      "text": "我靠稍等啊啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 79,
      "start_ms": 229580,
      "end_ms": 232020,
      "text": "傀儡的儡是三个铁傀"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 80,
      "start_ms": 234520,
      "end_ms": 235620,
      "text": "他不过是傀儡"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 81,
      "start_ms": 235620,
      "end_ms": 236220,
      "text": "是谁的傀儡"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 82,
      "start_ms": 236220,
      "end_ms": 237600,
      "text": "是法则的傀儡"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 83,
      "start_ms": 237600,
      "end_ms": 239160,
      "text": "法则的傀儡"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 84,
      "start_ms": 239160,
      "end_ms": 241840,
      "text": "实际上它是一个法则的什么载体"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 85,
      "start_ms": 243559,
      "end_ms": 246579,
      "text": "或者说是一个中介法则施加影响"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 86,
      "start_ms": 246579,
      "end_ms": 247419,
      "text": "对谁施加影响"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 87,
      "start_ms": 247419,
      "end_ms": 249219,
      "text": "对表象施加影响的一个中介"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 88,
      "start_ms": 249219,
      "end_ms": 254079,
      "text": "所以这个本体这个时候你会发现这个本体是一个既看不见"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 89,
      "start_ms": 254079,
      "end_ms": 255579,
      "text": "本体是表象背后的东西"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 90,
      "start_ms": 255579,
      "end_ms": 257509,
      "text": "看不见也怎么样"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 91,
      "start_ms": 257509,
      "end_ms": 258559,
      "text": "无意义"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 92,
      "start_ms": 258559,
      "end_ms": 260539,
      "text": "它是一个纯粹的终结"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 93,
      "start_ms": 260539,
      "end_ms": 263720,
      "text": "真正的意义在人家这里的了解吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 94,
      "start_ms": 263720,
      "end_ms": 265340,
      "text": "这样结构一剖析"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 95,
      "start_ms": 265340,
      "end_ms": 266180,
      "text": "你就会发现"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 96,
      "start_ms": 266180,
      "end_ms": 269140,
      "text": "庸俗唯物主义里面所预设的那个本体"
